      "content": "That sounds like a very \"middle ground\" answer, but I'm looking for more specifics for the committee. When you say the security-focused model \"defers essential issues,\" aren't you implying that strict enforcement is essentially a stalling tactic rather than a valid policy goal? Why wouldn't a country prioritize sovereignty and rule of law as the foundation for any kind of stability before looking at integration?",
